 "note": "High school identified from the printed title 'HIGH SCHOOL FACULTY / STAFF ROSTER' (line 1) and principal Michael Barney. Two columns, each 'name  role'; every cell placed by its Textract x-position (left names ~0.09, right names ~0.48), which settles the single-name rows. grade_or_dept is the department heading above the person in their own column; rows 2-4 sit above any heading and carry none. Lines 12 (Michael Esposito), 20 (Kaitlin Quinn), 28 (Suzanne Richardson), 35 (Karma Tousignant) and 37 (Phil McMurray) are right-column only. Line 31's right cell 'Media Specialist' is printed in the name column as a label; it is recorded as the grade_or_dept of Pamela Vallee below it. Peter McCauliff (AD) and Darlene Steele (Athletic Sec'y), lines 29-30, follow Suzanne Richardson in the right column with no department heading of their own, so grade_or_dept is left empty rather than inherited from Unified Arts. Lines 21-22, 29, 34, 36, 41 and 48 hold a heading in one column and a person in the other and are entry lines. Line 53 is the page number."
